			title: "Flexible Markers"
			description: ["Glowstone, lapis and a redstone torch. Markers define where a machine digs.", "", "Place one and RIGHT-CLICK it to open its GUI: you type the area size in", "directly rather than dragging out a rectangle.", "", "Note: the plain Marker Plus has no recipe in this version. Flexible Markers", "and Chunk Markers are the two you actually build."]
