			title: "Chunk Markers"
			description: ["Three Flexible Markers make one Chunk Marker.", "", "A Chunk Marker snaps its area to chunk boundaries, which is what you want", "for anything long-running -- a chunk-aligned dig is a chunk you can", "force-load exactly."]
