			title: "Y Setter"
			description: ["Glass, lapis and any marker.", "", "Right-click a quarry with it to set the Y level it stops at. It answers", "'Quarry digs to <y>'.", "", "Without one the quarry goes to bedrock. Set a floor when you only want", "the deepslate layer and not the whole column."]
