			title: "Chunk Destroyer"
			description: ["A Quarry, four Chunk Markers, two emeralds and green dye.", "", "The Chunk Destroyer clears its whole marked region in one pass rather", "than head-by-head, and by default it VOIDS common material -- stone, dirt,", "gravel -- keeping only what is worth keeping.", "", "This is the machine that gets you uraninite and diamonds in bulk."]
