			description: ["Obsidian and two markers make a Remove Bedrock Module.", "", "You do not place it. Put the module and a Quarry or Chunk Destroyer", "together in a crafting grid to install it into that machine.", "", "The machine then mines bedrock. In the Nether that means the roof too."]
