			description: ["A Quarry, two diamonds, buckets, markers and green dye.", "", "The Advanced Pump is standalone -- it does not attach to a quarry.", "Place it directly ABOVE a fluid block and it drains the body out.", "", "Its Delete toggle voids what it pulls instead of tanking it, which is how", "you dry out an ocean trench before digging it. Frame toggle stops it", "building the visible frame."]
